ict","source":"bangumi","value":"58"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"45"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Shiina is a cheerful girl that wants to create the Wonderfulness club. She enjoys people watching and finds wonder in those everyday small moments that most people would miss. She falls in love with Akira at first sight after he saves her from falling over one day. She actually loves to write poems and wants to create a poetry club but is too embarrassed to do so."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"from Zettai Renai"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c52653"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"毎日が新鮮に感じられ、その純真な感性にかかれば、コンビニ袋にでも発見を見出し、感激してしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"優しい性格で、誰とでも分け隔てなく接することができる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"日々「感動すること」 「素敵なもの」を探し、校内・町内あちこちを歩き回っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"感激の気持ちを人に伝えたいとポエムに挑戦するが上手に書けず、文芸部の主人公に教えを請う。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12749","sourceWorkId":"24262","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"素敵発見部を立ち上げるべくやって来た女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"優しくおっとりした性格で、誰とでも分け隔てなく接することができる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性別問わず手を掴んで触れ合うようなコミュニケーションをとることも多いので、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ともすれば勘違いする男子が出てきてもおかしくない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"日々 “感動すること” や “素敵なもの” を探し、あちこちを歩き回っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その純真な感性にかかれば、コンビニ袋にでも発見を見出し、感激してしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"この気持ちを人に伝えたいとポエムに挑戦するが上手に書けず、文芸部の主人公に教えを請う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「えへへ、また会っちゃいましたね先輩っ！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"47627"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"所属","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"47627","value":"素敵発見部"},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"88 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12749","sourceWorkId":"24262","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"f","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12749","sourceWorkId":"24262","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"157 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"eg